### Create Section
POST localhost:8080/api/section/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderNumber": 2,
  "nameUz": "Asosiy 4",
  "nameRu": "Основной 4",
  "nameEn": "Main 4",
  "sectionKey": "3"
}

### GET Section All
GET localhost:8080/api/section/get

### GET BY ID
GET localhost:8080/api/section/get/by-id/4

### DELETE Section By id
DELETE localhost:8080/api/section/delete/3

### UPDATE Section By id
PUT localhost:8080/api/section/update/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderNumber": 2,
  "nameUz": "Asosiy 4",
  "nameRu": "Основной 4",
  "nameEn": "Main 4",
  "sectionKey": "8"
}

### GET BY ORDER NUMBER
GET localhost:8080/api/section/get/by-order-number/3

### PAGINATION
GET localhost:8080/api/section/paging?page=1&size=10


### FILTER
POST localhost:8080/api/section/filter?page=1&size=10
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "createdDateFrom": "2026-10-30T20:24:41",
  "createdDateTo": "2026-11-01T16:45:24"
}

### GET SECTION BY LANGUAGE
GET localhost:8080/api/section/lang
